.TH DANBY-CRICKETSWING 1
.SH NAME
danby-cricketswing \- aerodynamic swing of a cricket ball
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/cricketswing
.SH MODEL
An effective signed swing coefficient represents the asymmetric aerodynamic
force created by seam orientation and boundary-layer differences.  It acts
laterally while gravity and drag determine drop and loss of speed.
.SH DISPLAY
Synchronized side and plan views distinguish swing from vertical motion.
Tracks alter release speed, elevation, aim, drag, swing, and gravity.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/cricketswing.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR flight3d (2)
